WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Select the company, then open the blue account dropdown → Settings → App appearance.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.333
Step 2: In Colours, choose Standard or Liquid Glass under Interface style and review the sample. Change company colours, app/sidebar logos or available font settings as needed.

3
00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:21.333
Step 3: Save the section’s settings and check an ordinary app page in both themes.

4
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:27.333
Step 4: Use authorised shared sign-in controls only when changing the platform’s sign-in appearance.
